<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major>Auto Fire for Semi Auto Weapons</Major>
    <Description>Pretty simple macro. Adds automatic fire for semi automatic weapons. This DOES NOT affect recoil at all. Due to the fire rate cap in r6, this has a delay of around 64ms, allowing for single tap fire as well. It uses the middle mouse key to allow for a left click macro that does affect recoil, so make sure to put this macro on your middle click and to set middle click as a fire button in your r6 settings</Description>
    <Comment>https://keyran.net - Free macros download | Скачать бесплатные макросы </Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>1</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
    <KeyUp>
      <Syntax></Syntax>
    </KeyUp>
    <KeyDown>
      <Syntax>MiddleDown 1
Delay 64
MiddleUp 1
Delay 64</Syntax>
    </KeyDown>
    <Software>Tom Clancy's Rainbow Six Siege</Software>
  </DefaultMacro>
</Root>